data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_0687167608160faa016acd2ba2e0308197805cf1bec8646a7e","output_index":0,"sequence_number":92,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Improving SQL tasks**\n\nI’m thinking about how to improve the SQL moveTask function so that deleted entries aren’t required for the routing check. I might need to adjust the deleted rename textbox that reads the title. The requirement states that \"deleted rows retain existing title,\" and that controls for reading should work even if the rename textbox is empty. Overall, everything seems fine, but I’ll need to add some notes to the README since it’s currently missing details."}

